msgid "Cookies give this site your browser's sign-in for it. Use only with sites you trust. Firefox works best: Chrome and Edge on Windows often block other apps from reading their cookies. Close the browser before downloading."
msgstr "Cookie 会让此网站使用您在浏览器中的登录状态。仅用于您信任的网站。建议使用 Firefox：Windows 上的 Chrome 和 Edge 经常阻止其他应用读取 Cookie。下载前请关闭浏览器。"

msgid "Cookies give this site your browser's sign-in for it. Use only with sites you trust. The Flatpak cannot see browser profiles until you allow it read access to them, for example ~/.mozilla with Flatseal."
msgstr "Cookie 会让此网站使用您在浏览器中的登录状态。仅用于您信任的网站。Flatpak 需要获准读取浏览器配置文件，例如通过 Flatseal 允许读取 ~/.mozilla。"

